    67	class LinkedSurfaceService:
    68	    """Validate, snapshot and refresh linked surfaces with owner context and a mandatory guard (spec §3 M5).
    69	
    70	    Owner authorization gates every ``(tenant, slug)`` descriptor as an opaque data-plane source: resource
    71	    identity is ``source_type="query_slug"``, ``source_id=f"{tenant or 'public'}:{slug}"`` (PBAC policies key
