   181	    module-level, framework-response-agnostic function so it cannot drift
   182	    between the two routes. Returns ``(record, None)`` on success, or
   183	    ``(None, (message, status))`` on failure — the caller builds the actual
   184	    ``web.Response`` with its own response helper.
