    68	    ``recipe_name``/``recipe_owner``/``recipe_params`` to make the surface
    69	    *refreshable* — a later ``POST .../refresh`` re-runs that recipe and
    70	    updates this same row in place, rather than replaying nothing at all.
    71	    """
