   174	        (TASK-2704): explicit ``surface_store`` > lazy-import
   175	        ``PgUISurfaceStore``. Raises an actionable ``RuntimeError`` — never a
   176	        bare ``ModuleNotFoundError`` — when ai-parrot-server is unavailable
   177	        and no store was injected.
   178	
   179	        For a linked envelope (FEAT-598 S1/S2), delegates to
   180	        ``LinkedSurfaceService.validate_for_persistence`` + ``ensure_snapshot``
   181	        in the owner's context before persisting — ``LinkedGuardRequired``,
   182	        ``AuthorizationRequired``, ``CatalogValidationError``, and
   183	        ``SnapshotError`` all propagate; nothing is saved on failure.
