   475	                ``publish_recipe``'s ``owner``, when applicable).
   476	            recipe_params: Params snapshot used to produce this envelope —
   477	                the refresh lane's "stored" precedence tier.
   478	            overwrite: Replace an existing ``surface_id`` row. When False
   479	                (default), a collision raises ``ValueError`` (store semantics).
   480	            surface_store: Injection seam (spec §8) — an explicit
   481	                ``PgUISurfaceStore``-shaped store. Takes precedence over a
   482	                ``self._surface_store`` attribute the hosting bot may carry,
   483	                which in turn takes precedence over lazily importing the
   484	                default ``PgUISurfaceStore`` from ai-parrot-server (core MUST
   485	                NOT import server code at module level — one-way import rule).
   486	            user_id: Attributed owner of the row. Falls back to
   487	                ``self.user_id`` (when the hosting bot carries one) and
   488	                finally to the resolved ``agent_id`` (self-authored surface,
   489	                never invented from nothing) — see the Completion Note for
   490	                TASK-2704's resolution of this injection seam.
   491	            session_id: Optional originating session, attached verbatim.
   492	
   493	        Returns:
   494	            The persisted ``surface_id``.
   495	
   496	        Raises:
   497	            ValueError: On a ``surface_id`` collision when ``overwrite`` is
   498	                False (propagated from the store).
   499	            RuntimeError: When no store is injected/wired AND
   500	                ai-parrot-server is not installed — an actionable message,
   501	                never a bare ``ModuleNotFoundError``.
   502	            LinkedGuardRequired: A linked envelope with no data-plane guard
   503	                configured — fails CLOSED; nothing is saved (FEAT-598 AC14).
   504	            AuthorizationRequired: The owner is not permitted one of the
   505	                envelope's data sources; nothing is saved.
   506	            CatalogValidationError: The linked envelope fails structural
   507	                validation; nothing is saved.
   508	            SnapshotError: The save-time snapshot could not be produced;
   509	                nothing is saved.
   510	        """
   511	        envelope_model = envelope if isinstance(envelope, CreateSurface) else CreateSurface.model_validate(envelope)
